bviz bundles and derives from the third-party work listed here. Each entry
gives what the work is, where it came from, and where its terms are recorded.
Every file in LICENSES/ is named for the work it covers; none of them states
bviz's own terms, which are not settled, and nothing below grants any.

## Compiled into the binaries

The fonts and the icon set are embedded with `include_bytes!` by //ui/assets,
so every binary built against it redistributes them and is bound by their
terms. Each is fetched with its own licence text, which the archive's BUILD
overlay in 3rd-party/ points its licence declaration at.

